{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：17:09 2026-11-09 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:37 2026-11-09 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:37 2026-11-09 HKT</p><img alt=\"海洋公園摩天塔疑故障有人被困 消防飛將軍游繩救援\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/808410eb2580177d92674842191f883c/2026-11/KF_me_2.png\"/><p>海洋公園今日（11月9日）下午3時許有人報案，表示摩天塔懷疑故障，乘客被困，有人不適，消防及救護員趕至處理。社交平台有目擊者稱，展望台被升至高處，久久未有下降，附近遊客仰望。下午4時許，消防飛將軍游繩將其中一名被困人士救落地。至於其他被困乘客，據悉是在職員帶領下，沿安全通道返回地面。</p><p>目前意外原因仍在調查。資料顯示，摩天塔位於海拔200米高，展望台可攀升至72米的高空，供旅客欣賞香港仔和離島的海岸景色。去年5月，摩天塔亦曾發生故障，當時導致17名乘客被困近兩小時。</p><img alt=\"消防飛將軍游繩救援。threads：ksaryn\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c3c932c5efc2fe8e25b9af41894a7756/2026-11/890282916_17994570663115688_7931218060963662816_n.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防飛將軍游繩救援。threads：ksaryn\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c78c2abda74aefd2c09579c9cceb842/2026-11/collage_32.jpg\"/><img alt=\"目擊者稱摩天塔展望台被升至高處，惟久久未有下降。Threads：nickdoraemon\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45e4bc9a289e65885aaefdcdaf1759ea/2026-11/o3.png\"/><img alt=\"目擊者稱摩天塔展望台被升至高處，惟久久未有下降。Threads：nickdoraemon\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5c9618c07cec90492b29fda6ee91f9cb/2026-11/o1_0.png\"/><img alt=\"事件引起附近遊客仰望。Threads：nickdoraemon\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afc9e4ef1e4cd8917218f4829c9f762e/2026-11/o2.png\"/><img alt=\"現場為海洋公園。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87261084a56a0c3c7b0ee0f2509ae8ea/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-09_at_17_33_00.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為海洋公園。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4445d152c2d3d98cc141f2e65cc560fc/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-09_at_17_32_59.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"海洋公園摩天塔的觀景台，事後仍未降落至地面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/11dd736dfcbbcdcef35ad4eb7efdeb45/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-09_at_17_32_38.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.007235+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:09:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:28.156631+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:28.156631+00:00","content_hash":"22afb9e25eb5aa9b0f19ca90eca58d07670d5d85a634cafa09965a82979280fd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}